public async Task<IPackage> Delete(int id)
{
var model = await Get(id);
if (model == null) return null;
context.Packages.Remove(model as Package);
model.AddDomainEvent(
new PackageDeleteEvent(
model.Id, (model as Package).EntityVersion));
return model;
}
It reads the entity from the database and formally removes it from the Packages dataset.
This will force the entity to be deleted in the database when changes are saved to the
database. Moreover, it adds PackageDeleteEvent to the aggregate list of events.
